  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The reference open-source platform for medical image visualisation and research — 2.5k stars, v5.10.0 (March 2026), BSD-style, NIH-supported, built on ITK and VTK. Widely used in academic medical centres globally. Related to ITK and MONAI in the MACH catalog: ITK provides the segmentation/registration algorithms; 3D Slicer provides the full desktop application and extension ecosystem on top. Essential infrastructure for medical imaging research and clinical translation.",
